  "job_B8.1.7.2_20251003_114824": {
    "chunk_text": "Samson heora syrwunga undergeat, & aras on midre nihte tomiddes his feondum & genam Hine beswac swa \u00feeah si\u00f0\u00f0an an wif, Dalila gehaten, of \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enan folce, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he hire s\u00e6de, \u00d0a ahsode heo hine georne mid hire ol\u00e6cunge on hwam his miht w\u00e6re? And he hire andwirde: Gif ic beo gebunden mid seofon rapum of sinum geworhte, sona ic beo \u00d0\u00e6t swicole wif \u00fea begeat \u00fea seofon rapas, & he \u00feurh syrwunge swa wear\u00f0 gebunden. & him mann cydde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r comon his find; \u00f0a tobr\u00e6c he sona \u00fea rapas swa swa hefel\u00fer\u00e6das, & \u00fe\u00e6t He wear\u00f0 eft gebunden mid eallniwum rapum & he \u00fea tobr\u00e6c swa swa \u00fea o\u00f0re. Heo beswac hine swa \u00feeah, \u00fe\u00e6t he hire s\u00e6de \u00e6t nextan: Ic eom Gode gehalgod fram minum & heo let \u00fea swa. Heo \u00fea on sumum d\u00e6ge, \u00fea \u00fea he on sl\u00e6pe l\u00e6g, forcearf his seofan loccan & awrehte hine si\u00f0\u00fean; & \u00fea Philistei gefengon hine sona, swa swa heo hine bel\u00e6wde, & gel\u00e6ddon hine aweg; & heo h\u00e6fde \u00d0a weoxon his loccas & his miht eft on him. & \u00fea Philistei full bli\u00f0e w\u00e6ron, \u00feancodon heora gode, Dagon gehaten, swilce hig \u00feurh his fultum \u00d0a Philistei \u00fea micele fyrme geworhton & gesamnodon hi on sumre upflora, ealle \u00fea heafodmen & & Samson \u00f0a plegode swi",
